{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：15:55 2026-10-15 HKT<br/>發佈時間：15:55 2026-10-15 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：15:55 2026-10-15 HKT</p><img alt=\"巴基斯坦學校屋頂瞬間坍塌。法新社\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7f41e6a88165d4e48abe3e24a8c5fc74/2026-10/KF_7.png\"/><p>法新社報道，巴基斯坦西北部開伯爾普什圖省首府白沙瓦一間私立學校周四（15日）發生屋頂坍塌事故，造成至少27名學生和1名教師死亡，另有超過30人受傷，其中6人傷勢嚴重。</p><img alt=\"救援人員在白沙瓦一間學校屋頂坍塌後展開搜救行動。法新社\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/601649611efe7dbdf1dbe6c0301d1263/2026-10/AFP__20261015__D3C66KG__v1__HighRes__PakistanAccidentSchool.jpg\"/><img alt=\"救援人員在白沙瓦一間學校屋頂坍塌後展開搜救行動。法新社\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/08873835be6a412862b31860970f3831/2026-10/AFP__20261015__D3C67WE__v1__HighRes__PakistanAccidentSchool.jpg\"/><p>據白沙瓦市雷丁夫人醫院發言人阿西姆（Mohammad Asim）透露，17名學生和1名女老師在被送往醫院時已無生命跡象。目前尚不清楚導致此次坍塌的原因。</p><p></p><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-15T08:24:48.081453+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":243,"images":3,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-15T07:55:20+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-15T08:18:02.429330+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-15T08:18:02.429330+00:00","content_hash":"194ba4491c546305cfb1113a5525508c56e2dbb7d55ecc84d37182b3d7bc28b8","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}